WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.757
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:05.757
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:10.021
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:13.139
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.060
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:19.876
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:24.099
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.126 --> 00:00:26.994
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:27.021 --> 00:00:29.823
will produce a reasoned response and review it against

00:00:29.849 --> 00:00:35.205
explicit criteria no assessor result is claimed Outcomes linked

00:00:35.231 --> 00:00:39.784
to this activity EA-01 . 1 Translate an executive

00:00:39.863 --> 00:00:44.770
brief into agreed support priorities deliverables and review points

00:00:45.692 --> 00:00:50.178
EA-01 . 2 Prepare a working agreement covering diary

00:00:50.231 --> 00:00:57.415
access decision and spending limits communication preferences confidentiality personal

00:00:57.468 --> 00:01:04.060
tasks and availability EA-01 . 3 Distinguish EA responsibilities

00:01:04.099 --> 00:01:07.981
from those of a personal assistant office manager chief

00:01:08.007 --> 00:01:11.626
of staff and specialist adviser and refer work outside

00:01:11.678 --> 00:01:17.047
the agreed mandate EA-01 . 4 Present options and

00:01:17.152 --> 00:01:22.297
consequences when demands compete including effects on preparation time

00:01:22.626 --> 00:01:29.060
cost wellbeing and required protective decisions EA-01 . 5

00:01:29.244 --> 00:01:33.652
Agree a safe route for raising concerns resolving expectations

00:01:33.731 --> 00:01:36.942
and arranging an authorised deputy without making the role

00:01:36.994 --> 00:01:42.125
dependent on permanent availability Learning practice and acknowledgement are

00:01:42.138 --> 00:01:45.217
not an assessor result or workplace authorisation
